      "slug": "greytide-gamestore-four-tiles-no-map",
      "title": "Four Tiles, No Map",
      "project": "greytide",
      "idea": "Wave two, a grey dude with a head from the wrong kit walks a road the seed has shuffled, and meets a painted tower's careful eye",
      "request": "Wave two, a grey dude with a head from the wrong kit walks a road the seed has shuffled, and meets a painted tower's careful eye",
