      "prompt": "Arena rock anthem, 142 bpm, E minor. A five-piece: a big minor riff on two overdriven guitars in the mids, one holding chords and one a high counter-melody, a tight lean bass in eighths well under the mids, huge tom-led drums, a piano doubling the chorus melody. A gravelly male lead with a soaring top line and a massive gang chorus. Bruised and hopeful. Starts mid on drums then the riff, a long high chorus plateau, one half-time dip, a lifted final chorus. E minor, warm saturation, no harsh highs.",
